OL,3,GNEWSATrio deny charges over fatal
OL,4,Ashooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have pleaded not guilty to
OL,7,Fcharges relating to a fatal shooting at
OL,8,Fa traveller site.
OL,10,FShane Porter, 35, of Calcutt Park near
OL,11,FCricklade in Wiltshire, his father
OL,12,FEddie Porter, 74, and Tammy Brown, 42,
OL,13,Fboth of Luton in Bedfordshire, appeared
OL,14,Fat Bristol Crown Court on Friday
OL,15,Fcharged in connection with the murder
OL,16,Fof Jimmy Ward at the Calcutt traveller
OL,17,Fsite on 2 August.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
