OL,3,GNEWSATrio deny charges over fatal
OL,4,Ashooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FShane Porter denied charges of murder
OL,7,Fand possessing a shotgun without a
OL,8,Fcertificate. Eddie Porter and Brown
OL,9,Fboth denied charges of assisting an
OL,10,Foffender and possessing a shotgun
OL,11,Fwithout a certificate.
OL,13,FThe defendants, who all appeared via
OL,14,Fvideo link, will stand trial in
OL,15,FFebruary 2027.
